        "paragraphs": [
          "Ask how a small change to an input or learned setting changes a selected result. A gradient measures that influence; a zero influence and an unavailable measurement mean different things.",
          "Combine several small observation groups before one training adjustment. Mean weights observations fairly, including a short final group. Reset removes earlier accumulated gradients before the next adjustment.",
          "Connect both policy recipes and supplied SGD to Train. The checker measures real execution against an independent reference. Private assessment keeps its measured tables hidden."
