        "paragraphs": [
          "Keep selected learned arrays fixed while other arrays learn. Inherit keeps the model\u2019s original flag; Frozen prevents parameter adjustments; Trainable allows them.",
          "Frozen settings do not put a model in evaluation mode or disable influence through it. The next-run exercise loads a real saved parent and creates fresh optimizer memory under the selected flags.",
